===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A sometimes fatal condition resulting from the formation of [[nitrogen]] bubbles in the [[blood]] and tissues, because of too rapid decompression, seen especially in deep-sea divers ascending rapidly from a dive. It is characterized by severe pains in the joints and chest, skin irritation, cramps, [[nausea]], and [[paralysis]].
#: {{syn|en|aeroembolism|aeroemphysema|the [[bends]]|caisson disease}}

